1
00:00:00,262 --> 00:00:02,712
(Sheldon:)Because it made me realize
they'll just send anyone up there.

2
00:00:05,801 --> 00:00:07,541
(Sheldon:)-Aren't you going to let me out?
-No.

3
00:00:07,703 --> 00:00:09,583
(Sheldon:)But I still need to use the bathroom.

4
00:00:09,738 --> 00:00:11,478
(Howard:)Here you go. Be creative.

5
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:17,450
(Howard:)What's the matter?
Scared of a little turbulence?

6
00:00:17,946 --> 00:00:21,226
(Sheldon:)No, turbulence is
just the equalization

7
00:00:21,383 --> 00:00:24,093
(Sheldon:)of diurnal temperature
variations in the atmosphere.

8
00:00:24,253 --> 00:00:25,793
(Sheldon:)I'm not scared at all.

9
00:00:26,555 --> 00:00:28,555
(Sheldon:)Oh, apple juice,
stay where you are.

10
00:00:30,592 --> 00:00:33,002
(Howard:)Oh, this is nothing.
I experienced way worse

11
00:00:33,162 --> 00:00:34,902
(Howard:)when I was plummeting
back to Earth,

12
00:00:35,063 --> 00:00:37,673
(Howard:)apparently not being
a real astronaut.

13
00:00:40,002 --> 00:00:41,672
Okay, that was a big ons.

14
00:00:43,839 --> 00:00:45,249
(Sheldon:)I take it back.
I'm scared of turbulence!

15
00:00:45,407 --> 00:00:46,947
(Howard:)I'm gonna need that bag back.

16
00:00:50,979 --> 00:00:52,249
(Leonard:)You sure you want to do this?

17
00:00:52,414 --> 00:00:54,454
(Penny:)Yeah. Why wouldn't I want
to get my old job back?

18
00:00:54,616 --> 00:00:56,026
(Penny:)It'll be fun to see everyone.

19
00:00:56,185 --> 00:00:58,135
(Penny:)I haven't talked to them
since I said, "I quit.

20
00:00:58,287 --> 00:01:01,027
See you at the Oscars, bitches."

